%!PS
% SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 EfterScript contributors
% SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
% Scenario: a guarded job without a backend. pdfmark is undefined, so
% the guard installs cleartomark in its place and the mark is discarded
% with nothing else changed; the program's own output is the check.
% backend: none
% oracle: skip build without a graphics backend
% expect-output: 0
% expect-output: done
/pdfmark where { pop } { userdict /pdfmark /cleartomark load put } ifelse
[ /Title (Guarded) /DOCINFO pdfmark
count =
(done) =
